When the harness supplies a rejection with a failed scene and its current source, return the COMPLETE direction but change only that scene's source or parameters needed to fix the concrete diagnostic. Preserve every successful scene byte-for-byte, including its native content and timing; do not restart the creative design. If the rejection concerns total duration, scene count or supplied copy, correct only the fields needed to satisfy it.
